{"id": "119922", "name": "אינטגרל של a^x – פונקציה מעריכית בבסיס כללי", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "arccos", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><p>חשבו, ואל תשכחו את הקבוע</p><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( \\displaystyle \\int {{CT:0}}\\,d{{CT:1}} = \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> כותבים את <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(a^x\\)</span> כחזקה של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e\\)</span> ומבצעים אינטגרציה של פונקציה מעריכית.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — כתיבה בבסיס e</b><br><p>תוך שימוש בחוקי לוג</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ e^{\\ln(x)} = x \\]</p><p>וגם</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\ln(x^k) = k \\cdot \\ln(x) \\]</p><p>נקבל ש</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} a^x &= e^{\\ln(a^x)} \\\\ &= e^{x\\cdot \\ln(a)} \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — אינטגרציה</b><br><p>לכן</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\begin{aligned} \\int {{CT:0}} d{{CT:1}} &= \\int e^{x\\cdot \\ln(a)} d{{CT:1}} \\\\ &= {{CT:2}} \\end{aligned} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה נכונה</p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה נכונה חלקית</p>", "prtincorrect": "<p style=\"text-align: right;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: right;\">תשובה שגויה</p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "varss:listofvars(ans1);\nvarss:delete(a,delete(C,delete(c,varss)));\nan1:ans1;\nfor i:1 while i<=length(varss) do an1:ev(an1,varss[i]=v);\n\nta2:a^x/ln(abs(a))+c;\ndta2:ev(diff(ta2,v));\n\nstu:ev(diff(an1,v));\nc1:ev(diff(an1,c));\nc2:ev(diff(an1,C));\nd:c1^2+c2^2;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "stu", "tans": "p", "testoptions": "v", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "Result-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "d", "tans": "0", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "stu", "tans": "dta2", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "Result-3-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-3-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["p", "v"], "nvariants": 1}